recommend keep-going — constel-net r2 (settle a star + planet via settlement.mint, proving the whole topology settles in the fake net) is the next agent-doable crux; more double-seat cruxes remain (gratitude silos · queyqwinqkri Twilight theme as a web-search round); breach renames + seed force-push stay Keaton's hand
